config BR2_PACKAGE_ISP_LCD_PREVIEW
    bool "isp_lcd_preview (universal camera preview)"
    depends on BR2_TOOLCHAIN_HAS_THREADS
    select BR2_PACKAGE_DISPLAY
    select BR2_PACKAGE_VVCAM
    help
      Standalone live camera preview for the K230 that works on any
      display/camera config and on either core (scalar or RVV).

      Auto-detects the display connector at runtime:
        - HDMI / landscape DSI: passthrough rectangle, no rotation.
        - Portrait DSI LCD (e.g. 480x800): landscape capture buffer sized
          from the panel, 90-degree rotation, explicit portrait destination.
      This replicates the confirmed-working portrait geometry from the
      apriltag/tinytag apps instead of the generic v4l2-drm CLI, which cannot
      decouple the portrait destination from the source buffer.

      It is a preview utility only: it does not touch the ISP daemon,
      tuning files, or any application code.
